  "html": "<p><b>Level Prefixes</b> are the grey words that sit in front of the item name on ordinary drops. This is the full list (78 names).</p>\n<p>Also see <a href=\"/wiki/Modifiers\" title=\"Modifiers\">Modifiers</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Name_Descriptors\" title=\"Name Descriptors\">Name Descriptors</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Item_Prefixes\" title=\"Item Prefixes\">Item Prefixes</a>, and <a href=\"/wiki/Item_Suffixes\" title=\"Item Suffixes\">Item Suffixes</a>.</p>\n<table class=\"toc\" id=\"toc\" summary=\"Contents\"><tr><td><div id=\"toctitle\"><h2>Contents</h2></div><ul>\n<li><a href=\"#Amulets\">Amulets</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#Chain\">Chain</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#Cloth\">Cloth</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#Crystal\">Crystal</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#Ghost\">Ghost</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#Leather\">Leather</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#Padded\">Padded</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#Plate\">Plate</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#Splint\">Splint</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#Weapons\">Weapons</a></li>\n</ul></td></tr></table>\n<a name=\"Amulets\"></a><h2> <span class=\"mw-headline\">Amulets</span></h2>\n<p>10 names.</p>\n<table class=\"wiki-mod-table\">\n<tr><th>Word</th><th>Bonus</th><th>On</th></tr>\n<tr><td>Ceremonial</td><td>—</td><td>Amulets, Cloth, Rings</td></tr>\n<tr><td>Costume</td><td>—</td><td>Amulets, Rings</td></tr>\n<tr><td>Designer</td><td>—</td><td>Amulets, Rings</td></tr>\n<tr><td>Exquisite</td><td>—</td><td>Amulets, Rings</td></tr>\n<tr><td>Falsie</td><td>—</td><td>Amulets, Rings</td></tr>\n<tr><td>Ordinary</td><td>—</td><td>Amulets, Rings</td></tr>\n<tr><td>Ornate</td><td>—</td><td>Amulets, Rings</td></tr>\n<tr><td>Polished</td><td>—</td><td>Amulets, Crystal, Rings</td></tr>\n<tr><td>Tarnished</td><td>—</td><td>Amulets, Rings</td></tr>\n<tr><td>Wondrous</td><td>—</td><td>Amulets, Rings</td></tr>\n</table>\n<a name=\"Chain\"></a><h2> <span class=\"mw-headline\">Chain</span></h2>\n<p>10 names.</p>\n<table class=\"wiki-mod-table\">\n<tr><th>Word</th><th>Bonus</th><th>On</th></tr>\n<tr><td>Aluminum</td><td>—</td><td>Chain, Plate, Scale, Splint</td></tr>\n<tr><td>Bicycle</td><td>—</td><td>Chain</td></tr>\n<tr><td>Bronze</td><td>—</td><td>Chain, Plate, Scale, Splint</td></tr>\n<tr><td>Gold</td><td>—</td><td>Chain, Plate, Scale, Splint</td></tr>\n<tr><td>Iron</td><td>—</td><td>Chain, Plate, Scale, Splint, Weapons</td></tr>\n<tr><td>Mithril</td><td>—</td><td>Chain, Plate, Scale, Splint</td></tr>\n<tr><td>Rusty</td><td>—</td><td>Chain, Plate, Scale</td></tr>\n<tr><td>Scrap Metal</td><td>—</td><td>Chain, Splint</td></tr>\n<tr><td>Silver Belted</td><td>—</td><td>Chain</td></tr>\n<tr><td>Steel</td><td>—</td><td>Chain, Plate, Scale, Splint</td></tr>\n</table>\n<a name=\"Cloth\"></a><h2> <span class=\"mw-headline\">Cloth</span></h2>\n<p>9 names.</p>\n<table class=\"wiki-mod-table\">\n<tr><th>Word</th><th>Bonus</th><th>On</th></tr>\n<tr><td>Acid-Wash</td><td>—</td><td>Cloth</td></tr>\n<tr><td>Canvas</td><td>—</td><td>Cloth</td></tr>\n<tr><td>Cotton</td><td>—</td><td>Cloth</td></tr>\n<tr><td>Expandex</td><td>—</td><td>Cloth</td></tr>\n<tr><td>Polyester</td><td>—</td><td>Cloth</td></tr>\n<tr><td>Spider Silk</td><td>—</td><td>Cloth</td></tr>\n<tr><td>Steel Woven</td><td>—</td><td>Cloth</td></tr>\n<tr><td>Tweed</td><td>—</td><td>Cloth</td></tr>\n<tr><td>Wool</td><td>—</td><td>Cloth</td></tr>\n</table>\n<a name=\"Crystal\"></a><h2> <span class=\"mw-headline\">Crystal</span></h2>\n<p>9 names.</p>\n<table class=\"wiki-mod-table\">\n<tr><th>Word</th><th>Bonus</th><th>On</th></tr>\n<tr><td>Clear</td><td>—</td><td>Crystal</td></tr>\n<tr><td>Cloudy</td><td>—</td><td>Crystal</td></tr>\n<tr><td>Pristine</td><td>—</td><td>Crystal</td></tr>\n<tr><td>Radiant</td><td>—</td><td>Crystal</td></tr>\n<tr><td>Rough</td><td>—</td><td>Crystal</td></tr>\n<tr><td>Shiny</td><td>—</td><td>Crystal</td></tr>\n<tr><td>Sparkling</td><td>—</td><td>Crystal</td></tr>\n<tr><td>Unclear</td><td>—</td><td>Crystal</td></tr>\n<tr><td>Vivid</td><td>—</td><td>Crystal, Ghost</td></tr>\n</table>\n<a name=\"Ghost\"></a><h2> <span class=\"mw-headline\">Ghost</span></h2>\n<p>9 names.</p>\n<table class=\"wiki-mod-table\">\n<tr><th>Word</th><th>Bonus</th><th>On</th></tr>\n<tr><td>Bright</td><td>—</td><td>Ghost</td></tr>\n<tr><td>Dim</td><td>—</td><td>Ghost</td></tr>\n<tr><td>Dull</td><td>—</td><td>Ghost</td></tr>\n<tr><td>Glimmering</td><td>—</td><td>Ghost</td></tr>\n<tr><td>Glowing</td><td>—</td><td>Ghost</td></tr>\n<tr><td>Opaque</td><td>—</td><td>Ghost</td></tr>\n<tr><td>Phasing</td><td>—</td><td>Ghost</td></tr>\n<tr><td>Shimmering</td><td>—</td><td>Ghost</td></tr>\n<tr><td>Twinkling</td><td>—</td><td>Ghost</td></tr>\n</table>\n<a name=\"Leather\"></a><h2> <span class=\"mw-headline\">Leather</span></h2>\n<p>10 names.</p>\n<table class=\"wiki-mod-table\">\n<tr><th>Word</th><th>Bonus</th><th>On</th></tr>\n<tr><td>Baby Seal Skin</td><td>—</td><td>Leather</td></tr>\n<tr><td>Basilisk Hide</td><td>—</td><td>Leather</td></tr>\n<tr><td>Buck Skin</td><td>—</td><td>Leather</td></tr>\n<tr><td>Demon Hide</td><td>—</td><td>Leather</td></tr>\n<tr><td>Jackalope Skin</td><td>—</td><td>Leather</td></tr>\n<tr><td>Mastodon Hide</td><td>—</td><td>Leather</td></tr>\n<tr><td>Squirrel Skin</td><td>—</td><td>Leather</td></tr>\n<tr><td>Whale Blubber</td><td>—</td><td>Leather</td></tr>\n<tr><td>Wolf Skin</td><td>—</td><td>Leather</td></tr>\n<tr><td>Wyrm Skin</td><td>—</td><td>Leather</td></tr>\n</table>\n<a name=\"Padded\"></a><h2> <span class=\"mw-headline\">Padded</span></h2>\n<p>10 names.</p>\n<table class=\"wiki-mod-table\">\n<tr><th>Word</th><th>Bonus</th><th>On</th></tr>\n<tr><td>Flubberized</td><td>—</td><td>Padded</td></tr>\n<tr><td>Galvanized</td><td>—</td><td>Padded</td></tr>\n<tr><td>Mithril Belted</td><td>—</td><td>Padded</td></tr>\n<tr><td>Molded</td><td>—</td><td>Padded</td></tr>\n<tr><td>Natural</td><td>—</td><td>Padded</td></tr>\n<tr><td>Recycled</td><td>—</td><td>Padded</td></tr>\n<tr><td>Steel Belted</td><td>—</td><td>Padded</td></tr>\n<tr><td>Synthetic</td><td>—</td><td>Padded</td></tr>\n<tr><td>Thermoset</td><td>—</td><td>Padded</td></tr>\n<tr><td>Vulcanized</td><td>—</td><td>Padded</td></tr>\n</table>\n<a name=\"Plate\"></a><h2> <span class=\"mw-headline\">Plate</span></h2>\n<p>3 names.</p>\n<table class=\"wiki-mod-table\">\n<tr><th>Word</th><th>Bonus</th><th>On</th></tr>\n<tr><td>Silver</td><td>—</td><td>Plate, Scale, Splint</td></tr>\n<tr><td>Tin</td><td>—</td><td>Plate, Scale, Splint, Weapons</td></tr>\n<tr><td>Titanium</td><td>—</td><td>Plate, Scale, Weapons</td></tr>\n</table>\n<a name=\"Splint\"></a><h2> <span class=\"mw-headline\">Splint</span></h2>\n<p>1 names.</p>\n<table class=\"wiki-mod-table\">\n<tr><th>Word</th><th>Bonus</th><th>On</th></tr>\n<tr><td>Treebark</td><td>—</td><td>Splint</td></tr>\n</table>\n<a name=\"Weapons\"></a><h2> <span class=\"mw-headline\">Weapons</span></h2>\n<p>7 names.</p>\n<table class=\"wiki-mod-table\">\n<tr><th>Word</th><th>Bonus</th><th>On</th></tr>\n<tr><td>Cardboard</td><td>—</td><td>Weapons</td></tr>\n<tr><td>Celestial</td><td>—</td><td>Weapons</td></tr>\n<tr><td>Diamond</td><td>—</td><td>Weapons</td></tr>\n<tr><td>Obsidian</td><td>—</td><td>Weapons</td></tr>\n<tr><td>Stone</td><td>—</td><td>Weapons</td></tr>\n<tr><td>Uber</td><td>—</td><td>Weapons</td></tr>\n<tr><td>Wooden</td><td>—</td><td>Weapons</td></tr>\n</table>\n<div class=\"visualClear\"></div>"
